hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: 'Jab tum juma ke din apne sathi se kaho: Khamosh raho! jabke imam khutba de raha ho to beshak tum ne laghw [bekar kaam] kiya.'"
"19","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: 'Jab tum juma ke din apne sathi se kaho: Khamosh raho! jabke imam khutba de raha ho to beshak tum ne laghw [bekar kaam] kiya.'"
"20","[AI-translation] Umar bin Abdul Aziz (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai: Ke Abdullah bin Ibrahim bin Qariz Zuhri ne unhen khabar di ke unhon ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko masjid ki [chhat] par wuzu karte hue dekha, phir unhon ne kaha: Main khushk paneer [aqit] ke tukdon ki wajah se wuzu kar raha hun jo main ne khaye, aur beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: 'Us [khane] se wuzu karo jise aag ne chhua ho.'"
"21","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Ibrahim bin Qariz se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah ko — jabke wo masjid ke upar the — wuzu karte hue dekha, phir unhon ne kaha: Kya tum jante ho main kis cheez se wuzu kar raha hun? Khushk paneer [aqit] ke tukdon se jo main ne khaye. Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: 'Us [khane] se wuzu karo jise aag ne chhua ho.' Aur Zuhri [Rahimahullah] us [khane] se wuzu karte the jise aag ne badal diya ho."
"22","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Qariz se riwayat hai: Ke unhon ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah ko masjid ke upar wuzu karte hue paya, phir [Abu Hurairah ne] un se kaha: Main khushk paneer [aqit] ke tukdon ke siwa kisi aur cheez ki wajah se wuzu nahin kar raha jo main ne khaye. Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us [khane] se wuzu karo jise aag ne chhua ho.'"
"23","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: 'Jab tum juma ke din apne sathi se kaho: Khamosh raho! jabke imam khutba de raha ho to beshak tum ne laghw [bekar kaam] kiya.'"
"24","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Ibrahim bin Qariz se riwayat hai: Ke unhon ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko masjid ki peeth par wuzu karte hue dekha, phir unhon ne kaha: Ye kaisa wuzu hai? Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Kya tum jante ho main kis cheez se wuzu kar raha hun?! Main khushk paneer [aqit] [ke tukdon] ki wajah se wuzu kar raha hun [jo main ne khaye], aur beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: 'Us [khane] se wuzu karo jise aag ne chhua ho.'"
"25","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Ibrahim bin Qariz se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko masjid par wuzu karte hue dekha, jabke unhon ne khushk paneer [aqit] ke tukde khaye the, phir unhon ne wuzu kiya. To main ne kaha: Kya tum khushk paneer [aqit] [khane] ki wajah se wuzu karte ho? To unhon ne kaha: Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: 'Us [khane] se wuzu karo jise aag ne chhua ho.'"
"26","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Abdullah bin Qariz se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hazrat Muawiyah bin Abi Sufyan (Raziyallahu anhu) ko — jabke wo Madinah mein mimbar par the — kehte hue suna: Aye Madinah walo! Tumhare fuqaha kahan hain? Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Aap ke mimbar ke paas is tarah ke jode [masnui baalon] se mana farmate hue suna. Phir unhon ne use apne sar par rakha — aur main ne use dulhan par us ki shadi ki raat mein ya us ke siwa kisi par Muawiyah par hone se zyada khubsurat nahin dekha — [aur Muawiyah ne kaha ke Aap ne] farmaya: 'Allah lanat farmaye godne wali aur godwane wali par, [chehre ke] baal ukhadne wali aur ukhadwane wali par, aur [danton mein] kushadgi karne wali aur karwane wali par.'"
